"user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T19:14:58Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T19:14:58Z","body":"Rebased.\r\n\r\nNow that #118229 has been merged, this should be good to go as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5285281421/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5285329178","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118227#issuecomment-5285329178","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118227","id":5285329178,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOwe5Gg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T19:19:29Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T19:27:27Z","body":"I think changing this to be the mostly useless `is_null` check doesn't seem right to me, I don't think the appropriate solution is to make these paths unsafe, at minimum this should have some benchmarking showing the need for this\r\n\r\nEven if the change to the callable check makes it safer it still has undesirable effects so it should be backed up by some appropriate benchmarking","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5285329178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5286597144","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118227#issuecomment-5286597144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118227","id":5286597144,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOxsSGA","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T21:28:38Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T21:37:10Z","body":"> so it should be backed up by some appropriate benchmarking\r\n\r\nSure, no problem.\r\n\r\nWhen running the MRP in #118229 with #118236 (which fixes the other half of this bottleneck) rebased on latest `master`, the `debug/settings/stdout/print_fps` output shows an FPS of 4-5 for me, on my 9950X3D + 9070 XT Linux machine:\r\n\r\n```\r\nProject FPS: 4 (250.00 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 4 (250.00 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 5 (200.00 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 4 (250.00 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 5 (200.00 mspf)\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen running that same MRP, again with #118236, but with this PR cherrypicked on top, you instead see an FPS of around 9400 (with VSync disabled):\r\n\r\n```\r\nProject FPS: 9386 (0.10 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 9333 (0.10 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 9342 (0.10 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 9484 (0.10 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 9459 (0.10 mspf)\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere's what Superluminal looks like without this PR:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1297\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260813_221941\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/26074658-ad60-43ed-8967-5bd126cf9495\" />\r\n\r\nAs you can see in the Function List in the lower left and the Statistics (for `CallableCustom::is_valid`) in the top right, we're spending almost 3.5 seconds out of the 4 seconds we've selected just in `Callable::is_valid` alone. This is spread out over 32 worker threads, so wouldn't necessarily be thought of as serial time, but since `ObjectDB::get_instance` is globally locked it can pretty much be read that way. So all these threads are just waiting for one another in `SpinLock` all the time.\r\n\r\nThe main view also tells a pretty chaotic story with all the thread synchronization arrows going everywhere, due to them blocking and unblocking eachother all the time.\r\n\r\nHere's what it looks with this PR:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1294\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260813_222206\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6927ba66-6cb9-4a4a-acaa-41939c3be996\" />\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nTo be clear, the specific `Callable::is_valid` calls that are causing the most problems are the ones in `JoltArea3D::has_body_monitor_callback` and `JoltArea3D::has_area_monitor_callback`. We could achieve largely the same effect by only swapping those out.\r\n\r\nHowever, I just don't see the point in using `Callable::is_valid` anywhere here. In all of these cases I only want to know whether the `Callable` is set, not whether it's pointing to a valid object/method (or whatever `is_valid` wants to do). Any `CallableCustom` will run that `is_valid` check in `callp` anyway, and non-custom `Callable` will be handled appropriately as of #118229.\r\n\r\nI should also note that this of course becomes much less of a problem if `ObjectDB::get_instance` is made lock-free, towards which there have been several attempts now (#98469, #118507, #118803, #122322, etc), but still, we simply don't need `Callable::is_valid` here in the first place.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5286597144/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5286774176","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118227#issuecomment-5286774176","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118227","id":5286774176,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOx3FoA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T21:48:10Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T21:48:10Z","body":"Thank you that clears things up!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5286774176/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5287750672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118227#issuecomment-5287750672","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118227","id":5287750672,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOyysEA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T23:58:57Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T23:58:57Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5287750672/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]